BEHAVIOR to-upper

DESCRIPTION
  Copies the null-terminated src into dst, converting ASCII a-z to A-Z.
  dst is null-terminated; length is the byte count (excluding the terminator).

CONTRACT
  INPUT src bytes 65536
  OUTPUT dst bytes 65536
  OUTPUT length int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 7b782d38

IMPLEMENTATION
  STORE dst 0 1 0
  i = 0

  LABEL loop
    c = LOAD src 1 i
    cz = IEQ c 0 1
    BRANCH cz fin body

  LABEL body
    cu = AND c 255 8
    ge = IGE cu 97 8
    le = ILE cu 122 8
    is_lower = AND ge le 8
    BRANCH is_lower upper keep

  LABEL upper
    up = ISUB cu 32 8
    STORE dst up 1 i
    JUMP adv

  LABEL keep
    STORE dst cu 1 i

  LABEL adv
    i = IADD i 1 8
    JUMP loop

  LABEL fin
    STORE dst 0 1 i
    STORE length i 8
END
